  "contract": "Retribution 707391 reads 'Melee damage dealt now has a $h% chance to strike 2 additional times for $s1% of the damage dealt as Holy Damage.' The server DBC gives e0 BasePoints 29, DieSides 1, so $s1 = 30, and each strike is Retribution 525028, Holy, unable to crit. Monster linear resistance gives a creature level x 1 Holy resistance, 5 per percent: 0.2% average resist at level 1, 12% at level 60. Two level 60 Templars with a Walking Stick and forced melee critical strikes swing for 1100 s, one with open-world level scaling off at a level 1 dummy and one at a level 60 dummy. The mean strike over the mean main-hand swing is 0.295 (0.285-0.305) unresisted and 0.264 (0.252-0.276) after the level 60 dummy's resist; a strike exempt from resistance would give about 0.295 on both, a wrong fraction moves the unresisted ratio.",
